    "$t": "粒積"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>顏月華</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">芒種雨　落bē離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落tī荷花ê葉仔頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一點一滴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Gô--過-來koh輾--過-去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">合倚--來koh散開--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大粒細粒　細粒大粒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">盡磅ê時　就做伊去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人生路　行無停</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">爛田準路　mā tio̍h行</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一步一跤印</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hua̍h大步koh勼細步</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">進前退後　退後進前</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">到路盡ê時　就做lán來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一世人ê粒積</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管偌tshia-iānn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">終歸尾　是一場空</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgeHrJbyx8LwzH7V7AS_PqvI6srVL_ggY0RXLfb4HWo3qDTdV-BMXuuxLuqQrbY5E_PJMsLhNKegmNu12OYQpKKxmf6hqX7THwb0LKygi0kPfeQdHFhBmaUV58ZweH7YCvKK54lkwUNwzs35gwBZ-texhdFRf2n9FvG0N7gU3oHHSQWTUQ0TIfSZ2_n_lDd/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgeHrJbyx8LwzH7V7AS_PqvI6srVL_ggY0RXLfb4HWo3qDTdV-BMXuuxLuqQrbY5E_PJMsLhNKegmNu12OYQpKKxmf6hqX7THwb0LKygi0kPfeQdHFhBmaUV58ZweH7YCvKK54lkwUNwzs35gwBZ-texhdFRf2n9FvG0N7gU3oHHSQWTUQ0TIfSZ2_n_lDd/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/s1424/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGB